Subject: [PATCH 02/15] test(14-01): add RED prometheus unit test stubs and
 BUILD.gn target (Wave 0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add chrome/browser/prometheus/BUILD.gn with prometheus_unittests test() target
- Add prometheus_color_mixer_unittest.cc: 4 RED tests (DarkModeAccent, LightModeBg,
  DarkModeBg, ColorIdRangeInChromeBounds) — RED until Plan 14-03 populates mixer
- Add prometheus_css_emission_unittest.cc: 2 RED tests verifying --color-prometheus-*
  CSS property emission via ConvertColorProviderColorIdToCSSColorId
- Add prometheus_asset_resource_unittest.cc: 4 EXPECT_TRUE(false) stubs for
  font/icon/brand IDR constants — RED until Plans 14-04/14-05
- Add kColorPrometheus* (20 ids) to chrome_color_id.h COMMON_CHROME_COLOR_IDS so
  tests compile (prerequisite for Wave 0 test target to build)
---
 chrome/browser/prometheus/BUILD.gn            | 26 +++++++++
 .../prometheus_asset_resource_unittest.cc     | 44 ++++++++++++++
 .../prometheus_color_mixer_unittest.cc        | 57 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../prometheus_css_emission_unittest.cc       | 30 ++++++++++
 chrome/browser/ui/color/chrome_color_id.h     | 21 +++++++
 5 files changed, 178 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 chrome/browser/prometheus/BUILD.gn
 create mode 100644 chrome/browser/prometheus/prometheus_asset_resource_unittest.cc
 create mode 100644 chrome/browser/prometheus/prometheus_color_mixer_unittest.cc
